{"id":92141204718989,"name":"[ALPHA] Route 06 ","desc":"\n⚠️ The game is on a alpha stage and plenty of features are still underdeveloped and unpolished, everything is subject to change. ⚠️\n\nWelcome to Route 06! A CO-OP game where you and 4 more friends drive across a randomly generated map with randomly generated structures, fighting to survive and using what you can to defend yourself along the way.\n\nUse a variety of different survivors each having their own abilities and fight hordes of zombies, with some of them having their own unique tweaks to spice up each run! \n\nThe game tries to give the player as much freedom as possible, giving you a chance to play the game at your own pace and however you want. \n\n\n\n","path":"/game/92141204718989-alpha-route-06","slug":"92141204718989-alpha-route-06","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/ace276d16af38ac6cd7406f6cfc98a1a5481779aac65cb05a2106e2b912b88fb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-da34175abeaa149ce73c2b2cf60b4719/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":447,"visitor":14148824,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T07:48:08.167Z","creator":{"name":"OutLaikRBLX","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"ALPHA-Route-06-ZuCrypt-Keyless-126858","_id":"69a540b8853e4e6d5c4b5863","title":"ZuCrypt Keyless","game":{"_id":"69749d5d6fe269b3ef1b3a61","gameId":92141204718989,"name":"[ALPHA] Route 06 ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":92141204718989},"features":"Route 06 Script\n\nFEATURES\n\nVisual System\n• Item ESP that highlights all items across the map in real-time\n• Displays Item Name, Rarity, and Sell Price information\n• Automatic detection when items spawn or disappear\n• Randomized highlight colors for better visibility\n• Ignore system to skip unwanted items\n• Ignored items are clearly marked\n\nZombie ESP (Esport Style)\n• Advanced zombie highlighting visible through walls\n• Real-time health bar display\n• Live HP counter\n• Clean zombie name detection\n• Special visual detection for Plague/Boss enemies\n• Smooth professional spectator-style UI\n\nAnti Dark Mode\n• Removes darkness, fog, rain, blur, and weather effects\n• Forces bright daylight environment\n• Improves visibility during night or storm events\n• Automatically disables rain particles and sounds\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nItem Teleport System\n• Instantly teleport to nearest valuable item\n• Automatically prioritizes items with price value or rare rarity\n• Safe teleport positioning above ground\n• Ignore current item feature to skip unwanted targets\n• Reset ignored item list anytime\n• Live ignored item counter display\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nCombat System\nAuto Attack (Head)\n• Automatically attacks zombies targeting head/root parts\n• Smart distance checking system\n• Adjustable attack delay\n• Adjustable attack range\n• Automatically detects newly spawned zombies\n• Multi-target handling with optimized threading\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMovement System\nWalkSpeed Modifier\n• Fully customizable player speed\n• Constant speed enforcement\n\nNo Clip\n• Walk through walls and obstacles freely\n• Stable collision bypass system\n• Automatically restores collision when disabled","tags":["Script Route","Script","Route","ZuCrypt Keyless","Keyless"],"script":"--Credit: Zucrypt (https://discord.com/invite/2RWyqdsW7c)\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://glot.io/snippets/hg9ygt4irx/raw/route06.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"696db4ca242dea933cfdbd06","username":"ZuCrypt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/86c3848ae16edf2b764ef29e42e429e6a4537963c5db731211288d485b6ffa86.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696db4ca242dea933cfdbd06-1769605534801.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"696db4ca242dea933cfdbd06","topMilestone":{"key":"